@startuml
title Live UiPlugin / RunenUI Integration Sequence

actor "Engine proof / automation" as Automation
participant "App" as App
participant "UiPlugin / AppUiExt" as Ui
participant "UiScreen" as Screen
participant "Runenwerk source / UiProgram" as Program
participant "Runenwerk binding/state" as State
participant "RunenUI AppRuntime" as RunenUI
participant "RunenUI HostRequest" as HostRequest
participant "Runenwerk action/host/domain policy" as Host
participant "Render adapter (later cut)" as RenderAdapter
participant "RenderPlugin" as Render

App -> Ui: app.mount_ui(CounterScreen)
Ui -> Screen: build_source()
Screen -> Program: UiTypedSource
Ui -> Program: lower + validate artifact
Ui -> RunenUI: mount public View/Element projection
RunenUI --> Ui: runtime slot mounted

App -> Ui: host data/state update
Ui -> State: UiEvaluator binding/state resolution
State --> Ui: UiStateModel
Ui -> RunenUI: submit public ReplaceResolvedState action
RunenUI -> RunenUI: pump + rebuild/publication

Automation -> RunenUI: public automation SemanticCommand::Activate

note over Automation,RunenUI
U3 proves semantic activation through public automation ingress.
Native pointer/keyboard/winit translation is a later consumer cut.
end note
RunenUI -> HostRequest: host request(route intent)
Ui -> HostRequest: inspect pending public request
HostRequest --> Ui: retained UiEventPacket (still pending)
Ui -> Host: typed route/capability/domain authorization
Host -> App: authorized owner mutation only
Host --> Ui: accepted / rejected decision
Ui -> RunenUI: complete host request with decision

note over RenderAdapter,Render
U3 does not migrate renderer publication.
The predecessor evaluator/frame publisher remains
explicitly isolated until a later consumer cut.
end note

RenderAdapter -> Render: future neutral RunenUI publication adapter

@enduml
